# Appendices # {#appendices}

## Texture Format Capabilities ## {#texture-format-caps}

### Plain color formats ### {#plain-color-formats}

All plain color formats support {{GPUTextureUsage/COPY_SRC}}, {{GPUTextureUsage/COPY_DST}}, and {{GPUTextureUsage/TEXTURE_BINDING}} usages.

Only those with a {{GPUTextureSampleType}} of {{GPUTextureSampleType/"float"}} may be blended.

The {{GPUTextureUsage/RENDER_ATTACHMENT}} and {{GPUTextureUsage/STORAGE_BINDING}} columns specify support for the {{GPUTextureUsage/RENDER_ATTACHMENT|GPUTextureUsage.RENDER_ATTACHMENT}} and {{GPUTextureUsage/STORAGE_BINDING|GPUTextureUsage.STORAGE_BINDING}} usages respectively.

